# el++ engine fixture 18 (src/test.slop: ksc-fixture-at, test-ksc-entailments).
# 18. K6: owl:Thing unsafe through ⊤ ⊑ ∃r.{a}; every class then reaches a.
# Inside el++ whole: the engine must answer every class as the literal Psc
# reference does (test-ksc-engine-matches-reference).

@prefix : <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty . :s a owl:ObjectProperty . :t a owl:ObjectProperty .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:E a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:hasValue :a ] .
:a a :D .
[ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:someValuesFrom :D ] rdfs:subClassOf :E .
